# Missing Pages Implementation

Agents building signup, legal, affiliates, leaderboard, or walls must follow this rule plus handwritten-code-style, Bun, SCSS nesting, i18n, and unplugin-icons rules.

**V5 root:** `c:\Users\Chris\Desktop\Development\Personal\sparkveyv5`

## Locked product defaults

- Referral commission: `config.referral.rate = 0.05` (signed sparks × rate → referrer pending)
- `createUser` → `maxAffiliateCodes: 2`
- Leaderboard: **monthly only** (no weekly cutover)
- AffiliateGraph: Phase 2 — do not build
- Walls: no Verisoul VPN check; verify OfferwallLinks before treating as final
- Login form rebuild: out of scope

## Stream ownership

| Stream | Owns (edit freely) | Must not touch |
|---|---|---|
| A Signup | `signup/**`, `src/utils/auth.ts` register helper, referral wire in `backend/routes/auth/email.ts`, `FrontendRedirectPaths.signup` | `affiliateCode.ts`, EarnDropdown, leaderboard, legal, walls |
| B Legal | `terms-of-service/**`, `privacy-policy/**` | any shared files |
| C Affiliates | affiliates page, GET `/affiliates`, `creditReferrerPendingEarnings`, `affiliateCode.ts`, first `updateUserBalance` hook line, `maxAffiliateCodes` default, `config.referral` | EarnDropdown, leaderboard files (leave room for D’s hook) |
| D Leaderboard | leaderboard types/utils/routes/worker/config/UI, second `updateUserBalance` hook line | overwriting C’s hook line |
| E Walls | `src/app/walls/**`, Offerwalls constants, WallItem, EarnDropdown, additive FrontendRedirectPaths | Navbar/Footer/proxy |

## Shared files

| File | Rule |
|---|---|
| `FrontendRedirectPaths.ts` | A lands `signup` first; E adds `walls` additively only |
| `EarnDropdown.tsx` | **E only** |
| Navbar / Footer / `src/proxy.ts` | **nobody** — already correct |
| `updateUserBalance` in `user.ts` | C lands first; D appends next to C’s line |
| `affiliateCode.ts` | **C owns edits**; A only imports/`useAffiliateCode` |

### Sparks earnings side effects

`updateUserBalance` (`backend/utils/userBalance.ts`) accepts an optional `afterCommit` callback (runs only when it owns/commits the session). Offer postbacks pass it to run referral + leaderboard via `applySparksEarningsSideEffects`. Redemptions and leaderboard payouts omit the callback. Do not hardcode those imports inside `updateUserBalance`.

Signup referral is resolved inside `createUser({ referralCode })` in one shot (sets `referredBy` + `referredByID`); do not call `useAffiliateCode` after create.

## Style

- V6 `FunctionResponse` — never port V5 `[err, data]` tuples
- Distributed lock via `createDistributedLock` / SyncGuard — not redlock
- Single-step signup matching `forgot-password` (not V5 two-step)
- i18n keys already exist; only add keys if a real gap appears (en first, then all locales)

## Explicit non-goals

- Login form rebuild
- AffiliateGraph / transaction `source` field
- Verisoul / `sessionID` on register
- Changing proxy walls exclusion
- Inventing new legal copy
- Weekly leaderboard cutover from V5
